.TH FREECLOUD 1 "June 2026" "FreeCloud 2.1.1" "User Commands"
.SH NAME
freecloud \- synchronize files with a self-hosted FreeCloud drive
.SH SYNOPSIS
.B freecloud
.SH DESCRIPTION
.B FreeCloud
is a desktop file browser and synchronization client for a FreeCloud
installation hosted in a PHP-enabled web account.
.PP
On first launch, enter the full website address of the hosted installation,
choose a local synchronization folder, and optionally enter a password.
.SH FILES
.TP
.I ~/.config/freecloud/last_config.json
Last-used desktop configuration.
.TP
.I ~/.local/state/freecloud/
Logs, process state, and the cached remote file tree.
.TP
.I LOCAL_FOLDER/.freecloud_client.json
Configuration for a synchronized local folder.
.TP
.I LOCAL_FOLDER/.freecloud_state.json
Synchronization state for a local folder.
.SH SECURITY
The desktop client currently stores the configured password in a local JSON
configuration file. Review the security notes in the installed README before
using FreeCloud with sensitive data.
